<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Sunrise Fair - (built 1985) 7,158 dwt sold for $7.35 million.</p>
<p>Cygnus Gas - (built 1996) 5,586 dwt sold to Turkish buyers for $17 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Borstel - (built 1980) 4,058 dwt sold for $4.5 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
